tests/integration/auth-state.json
# Raw per-scenario JSON/MD traces stay ignored — large, vary run-to-run from model
# non-determinism, no lasting value beyond debugging that specific session. The aggregate
# summary.txt per labelled run (see scripts/local/coach-quality-repeat.sh) is small and
# comparable across time, so it's tracked for baseline comparisons.
tests/coach-quality/reports/*
!tests/coach-quality/reports/*/
tests/coach-quality/reports/*/*
!tests/coach-quality/reports/*/summary.txt

